CM_ "j1939_generic.dbc — Universal J1939 signals. Works on ANY J1939 diesel truck.";
CM_ "All signals engine ECU SA 0x00 per SAE J1939-71. Body signals OEM-specific, not included.";
CM_ "For Kenworth T660 Cat C15, use kenworth_custom.dbc for BCM SA 0x31 signals.";
CM_ "Oil pressure omitted — Cat C15 uses byte 4 (proprietary), not byte 3 (standard).";